-- הסכם קיבוצי — שכר ותנאי עבודה של עובדי ההוראה בחטיבות העליונות לשנים
-- 2017–2022 (14.3.2018): the agreement between the local authorities (the
-- Centre of Local Government, the three large cities and the Centre of
-- Regional Councils) and ארגון המורים, as the corpus holds it: the final
-- text of 14.3.2018, faxed by the union that evening, its day of signing and
-- the director-general's notice in §24 left blank. It amends the merger
-- agreement of 5.9.2017, which had lowered the pay of teachers outside the
-- Oz LaTmura reform and of principals: new combined-salary tables (§4 and
-- annexes א'–ד'), shekel supplements (§5), the merger supplement (§6), the
-- 87 transition supplement (§8), carrying it out (§11), a one-time grant
-- (§17) and more; then the managers' budget (§18), the union's funds
-- (§§19–22), the agreement of 26.6.2014 extended (§23), the strike days made
-- up (§24), disputes void, exhaustion and industrial peace to 28.2.2022
-- (§§25–27), and one arrangement (§28).
--
-- Every rule of the agreement is encoded here. Circular תשע"ח/3
-- (l4/circulars/2017-18_tashach_03.l4) publishes its §§2–17 and §18(ב) for
-- the owners' high schools row for row, and imports this file: the circular
-- applies the agreement's rules and does not re-encode them (MMS-521,
-- MMS-663), so a circular that is later amended or misread cannot move the
-- agreement's rule. Where the circular prints a row with other words, the
-- rule here says what differs (the circular numbers two more paragraphs in
-- §4, so this agreement's §§4.2–4.3 are its §§4.3–4.5).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT minimum_wage_law
IMPORT wage_protection_law
IMPORT womens_work_law

-- not weighed against `the Hours of Work and Rest Law`: ‘משרה מלאה’ and
-- ‘היקף משרה’ here measure the position, as the base of a sum paid pro rata
-- to it or a threshold of eligibility; they set no working hour, day or
-- week, nor the pay of an hour the law counts.

§ `הסכם קיבוצי מיום 14.3.2018 — שכר ותנאי עבודה בחטיבות העליונות, 2017–2022`

§§ `המבוא`

-- akn:preamble/p1 A handwritten note at the head, "14.3.18 נוסח סופי" (the final text); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 akn:preamble/p3 The agreement's title and a blank for its day of signing; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p4 akn:preamble/p5 akn:preamble/p6 akn:preamble/p7 akn:preamble/p8 The employers: the Centre of Local Government for its local authorities save the three large cities, the three large cities, and the Centre of Regional Councils for its councils; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 akn:preamble/p10 akn:preamble/p11 The other side, ארגון המורים; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p12 A recital: the negotiation on pay and conditions for 1.9.2017–28.2.2022.
-- akn:preamble/p13 A recital: the importance of the teachers' standing to the quality of education.
-- akn:preamble/p14 A recital: the merger agreement of 5.9.2017 (outside the corpus).
-- akn:preamble/p15 A recital: carrying out the merger agreement lowered, against the parties' intent, the pay of teachers outside the Oz LaTmura reform and of principals, and the parties agreed to amend it.
-- akn:preamble/p16 akn:preamble/p18 A recital that the parties set their agreement down here, and the words of agreement; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p17 akn:art_4__para_4-2/p3 akn:art_8__para_8-1/p2 akn:art_11__para_11-2/p2 akn:art_13__para_13-1/p2 akn:art_16/p2 akn:art_17__para_e/p3 akn:art_18__para_b__subpara_2/p2 akn:art_24__para_a/p2 akn:art_28/p3 akn:conclusions/p2 Fax footers (the union's fax of 14.3.2018, 20:54–20:57, pages 1–13); no rule.

-- The Women's Work Law (imported): §17(ה) and (ז) count a month of the
-- birth and parenthood period as work for the grant, as unpaid leave after
-- it is not, and §17(ו) takes the position on its eve. The period harms
-- no right that turns on seniority (§6(ט)). The floor is met.
`§17 of 14.3.2018 counts the birth and parenthood period, as the Women's Work Law keeps it` MEANS
        `the month counts as work` (`grant month` WITH `position fraction that month` IS 0.8, `kind of month` IS `maternity and parenthood, reserve duty or unpaid sick leave`)
    AND NOT `the month counts as work` (`grant month` WITH `position fraction that month` IS 0.8, `kind of month` IS `unpaid leave, sabbatical or leave treated as unpaid`)
    AND `the birth and parenthood period harms no right that turns on seniority`
#ASSERT `§17 of 14.3.2018 counts the birth and parenthood period, as the Women's Work Law keeps it`

`the agreement of 14.3.2018 is the final text of` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 14 3 2018

`what the agreement of 14.3.2018 rests on outside the corpus` MEANS
    LIST `outside the corpus` "הסכם מיזוג רכיבים מיום 5.9.2017",
         `outside the corpus` "הודעת מנכ\"ל משרד החינוך בעניין החזר ימי לימודים ושעות לימודים בחטיבה העליונה בשל שביתה (סעיף 24, תאריכה ריק)",
         `outside the corpus` "ההסכמים הקיבוציים מיום 12.9.1995, 25.6.1995, 10.9.2003 ו־26.6.2014"

§§ `1 כללי`

-- (א): the preamble and the annexes are part of the agreement. (ב): the
-- headings are for convenience and not read for meaning.
@ref akn:art_1__para_a akn:art_1__para_b
`the preamble and annexes of 14.3.2018 are part of the agreement` MEANS TRUE
`the agreement of 14.3.2018 reads its headings for meaning` MEANS FALSE

§§ `2–3 תחולה והגדרות`

@ref akn:art_3/p1 akn:art_3/p2 akn:art_3/p4 akn:art_3/p5
DECLARE `employee category` IS ONE OF
    `a teacher in the reform`
    `a teacher not in the reform`
    `a principal in the reform`
    `a principal not in the reform`

@desc An upper-division teaching employee, as far as this agreement asks about her.
DECLARE `employee` HAS
    `covered by the Oz LeTmura agreement of 14.8.2011` IS A BOOLEAN @desc whether or not employed under the reform's terms
    `category` IS AN `employee category`

@ref akn:art_2/p1
GIVEN e IS AN `employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement applies to` e IF
    e's `covered by the Oz LeTmura agreement of 14.8.2011`

-- "מנהלים": principals in the reform and outside it.
@ref akn:art_3/p3
GIVEN c IS AN `employee category`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is a principal` c IF
    CONSIDER c
    WHEN `a principal in the reform`     THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a principal not in the reform` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

-- The two groups the agreement treats apart: teachers in the reform, and
-- teachers outside it together with all principals.
GIVEN c IS AN `employee category`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is outside the reform or a principal` c IF
    CONSIDER c
    WHEN `a teacher in the reform` THEN FALSE
    OTHERWISE TRUE

§§ `4 תוספת שכר — טבלאות השכר המשולב`

-- §4.1-§4.2, for teachers in the reform: the combined-salary tables rise
-- 18.212% from 1.9.2017 (annex A), are updated for seniority 1-7 from
-- 1.9.2018 (annex B), and rise a further 1.2% from 1.12.2018 (annex C).
-- The table in force is named here; its figures are this agreement's
-- annexes, encoded below (`the rows of the annex of 14.3.2018`).
DECLARE `combined-salary table` IS ONE OF
    `the tables before this agreement`
    `annex A, reform, from 1.9.2017`
    `annex B, reform, from 1.9.2018`
    `annex C, reform, from 1.12.2018`
    `annex D, outside the reform and principals, from 1.9.2018`

-- §4.1(1)-(2): 18.212% from 1.9.2017 (annex A), and from 1.9.2018 the
-- reform tables are updated for seniority 1 to 7 (annex B); above 7 the
-- annex-A table is read as continuing until 1.12.2018.
-- art_4__para_4-1 here, against circular תשע"ח/3's words: "בנספח" where the circular prints "כנספח", and the tables it names are annexed here (below).
@ref akn:art_4__para_4-1
GIVEN `the day` IS A DATE, `seniority` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `combined-salary table`
DECIDE `the reform table in force` `the day` `seniority` IS
    IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 12 2018
    THEN `annex C, reform, from 1.12.2018`
    ELSE IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 9 2018 AND `seniority` AT MOST 7
         THEN `annex B, reform, from 1.9.2018`
         ELSE IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 9 2017
              THEN `annex A, reform, from 1.9.2017`
              ELSE `the tables before this agreement`

`the reform update of 1.9.2017` MEANS 0.18212

-- §4.1(3): a further 1.2% from 1.12.2018 (annex C).
@ref akn:art_4__para_4-1
`the reform update of 1.12.2018` MEANS 0.012

-- akn:art_4__para_4-1/p2 Attaches annexes A, B and C; here the annexes are printed, and encoded below.

-- §4.3-§4.5, for teachers outside the reform and principals: no 18.212%
-- update (the one made under the merger agreement is cancelled back to
-- 1.9.2017, §4.5); from 1.9.2018 seniority 1-7 is updated by annex D.
@ref akn:art_4__para_4-2 akn:art_4__para_4-3
GIVEN `the day` IS A DATE, `seniority` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `combined-salary table`
DECIDE `the table in force outside the reform` `the day` `seniority` IS
    IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 9 2018 AND `seniority` AT MOST 7
    THEN `annex D, outside the reform and principals, from 1.9.2018`
    ELSE `the tables before this agreement`

-- akn:art_4__para_4-2/p2 Attaches annex D; here annex D is printed, and encoded below.

§§ `4 — the table in force, by group`

GIVEN e IS AN `employee`, `the day` IS A DATE, `seniority` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `combined-salary table`
DECIDE `the table in force for` e `the day` `seniority` IS
    IF `is outside the reform or a principal` (e's `category`)
    THEN `the table in force outside the reform` `the day` `seniority`
    ELSE `the reform table in force` `the day` `seniority`

§§ `5 תוספת שקלית 2016`

@desc A period of the updated 2016 shekel supplement and its amount for a full position.
DECLARE `shekel period` HAS
    `period from`          IS A DATE
    `period to`            IS A DATE @desc 31.12.9999 stands for "ואילך"
    `full-position amount` IS A NUMBER

-- §5a, for teachers in the reform (replacing section 4 of the merger
-- agreement): from 1.9.2017, in place of the amounts and dates of section
-- 4(b)(3)-(5) of the agreement of 23.3.2017, these.
-- art_5__para_a here, against circular תשע"ח/3's words: this copy misprints "הדשים" and "ש"ה" for "חדשים" and "ש"ח" in the amounts in words, which change no figure.
@ref akn:art_5__para_a
`the reform shekel supplement` MEANS
    LIST `shekel period` (Date 1 9 2017)  (Date 31 12 2017) 601,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 1 2018)  (Date 31 5 2018)  832.62,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 6 2018)  (Date 30 11 2018) 963.11,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 12 2018) (Date 31 12 2018) 1022.40,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 1 2019)  (Date 31 8 2019)  1122.40,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 9 2019)  (Date 31 12 2019) 1142.40,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 1 2020)  (Date 31 8 2020)  1222.40,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 9 2020)  (Date 31 12 2020) 1262.40,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 1 2021)  (Date 31 8 2021)  1342.40,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 9 2021)  (Date 31 12 9999) 1382.40

-- §5a's quoted (b), and its repetition in §5b for those outside the reform
-- and principals: the supplement's other rules, sections 4(c)-(h) of the
-- agreement of 23.3.2017 (part-position pro-rating among them), are
-- unchanged and apply to the updated 2016 supplement; they are not encoded
-- here.
@ref akn:art_5__para_a
`sections 4(c)-(h) of the agreement of 23.3.2017 still apply to the updated supplement` MEANS TRUE

-- §5b, for teachers outside the reform and principals: the same
-- replacement of section 4 of the merger agreement, with these amounts.
-- art_5__para_b here, against circular תשע"ח/3's words: the same misprints in the amounts in words.
@ref akn:art_5__para_b
`the shekel supplement outside the reform` MEANS
    LIST `shekel period` (Date 1 9 2017)  (Date 31 12 2017) 387.57,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 1 2018)  (Date 31 5 2018)  619.19,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 6 2018)  (Date 30 11 2018) 749.68,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 12 2018) (Date 31 12 2018) 808.97,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 1 2019)  (Date 31 8 2019)  908.97,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 9 2019)  (Date 31 12 2019) 928.97,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 1 2020)  (Date 31 8 2020)  1008.97,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 9 2020)  (Date 31 12 2020) 1048.97,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 1 2021)  (Date 31 8 2021)  1128.97,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 9 2021)  (Date 31 12 9999) 1168.97

@ref akn:art_5__para_b
`sections 4(c)-(h) of the agreement of 23.3.2017 still apply outside the reform` MEANS TRUE

-- §5c: the supplement paid to those outside the reform and principals
-- under the merger agreement's former section 4 is cancelled back to
-- 1.9.2017; the §5b schedule replaces it.
@ref akn:art_5__para_c
GIVEN e IS AN `employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the payment under the former section 4 is cancelled back to 1.9.2017 for` e IF
    `is outside the reform or a principal` (e's `category`)

§§ `5 — the supplement on a day, by group`

GIVEN ps IS A LIST OF `shekel period`
      `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the amount on` ps `the day` IS
    sum (map (GIVEN p YIELD p's `full-position amount`)
             (filter (GIVEN p YIELD `the day` AT LEAST p's `period from` AND `the day` AT MOST p's `period to`) ps))

GIVEN e IS AN `employee`, `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the updated shekel supplement 2016 for a full position` e `the day` IS
    IF `is outside the reform or a principal` (e's `category`)
    THEN `the amount on` `the shekel supplement outside the reform` `the day`
    ELSE `the amount on` `the reform shekel supplement` `the day`

GIVEN ps IS A LIST OF `shekel period`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the periods follow one another` ps IF
    all (GIVEN pair YIELD `Day` (pair's snd's `period from`) EQUALS `Day` (pair's fst's `period to`) PLUS 1)
        (zip (take (count ps MINUS 1) ps) (drop 1 ps))

#ASSERT `the periods follow one another` `the reform shekel supplement`
#ASSERT `the periods follow one another` `the shekel supplement outside the reform`

§§ `6 תוספת מיזוג רכיבים`

-- §6 adds section 5A to the merger agreement: from 1.9.2017 those outside
-- the reform and principals get the merger supplement, a uniform 18.951%
-- of the combined salary alone, raised from 1.12.2018 to 20.378%.
-- art_6/p1 here, against circular תשע"ח/3's words: it cites this agreement's §§4.2 and 4.3, which the circular numbers 4.3 and 4.5.
@ref akn:art_6/p1
GIVEN e IS AN `employee`, `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the merger supplement rate` e `the day` IS
    IF NOT `is outside the reform or a principal` (e's `category`)
    THEN 0
    ELSE IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 12 2018
         THEN 0.20378
         ELSE IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 9 2017
              THEN 0.18951
              ELSE 0

@ref akn:art_6/p1
GIVEN e IS AN `employee`, `the day` IS A DATE, `combined salary` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the merger supplement` e `the day` `combined salary` IS
    `the merger supplement rate` e `the day` TIMES `combined salary`

-- §6 (5A(d)-(e)): what the merger supplement counts for — percentage
-- supplements on the combined salary, the hourly value for substitution
-- hours, salary reduction for absence, severance pay, pension deposits
-- under section 46 of Oz LeTmura, the study fund and the Dafna fund — and
-- what not: topping up to the minimum wage (an "excluded supplement" under
-- the Minimum Wage Law, temporary provision of 2015).
DECLARE `purpose` IS ONE OF
    `percentage supplements computed on the combined salary`
    `the hourly value for substitution hours`
    `salary reduction for absence`
    `severance pay`
    `pension provident deposits under section 46 of Oz LeTmura`
    `the study fund and the Dafna fund`
    `topping up to the minimum wage`

@ref akn:art_6/p1
GIVEN u IS A `purpose`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the merger supplement counts for` u IF
    CONSIDER u
    WHEN `topping up to the minimum wage` THEN FALSE
    OTHERWISE TRUE

-- 20.378% is 18.951% with the whole salary raised 1.2%: (1.18951 × 1.012) − 1.
#ASSERT TRUNC ((1.18951 TIMES 1.012 MINUS 1) TIMES 100 PLUS 0.0005) 3 EQUALS 20.378

§§ `7 ביטול התוספות המאוחדות למורים שאינם ברפורמה ולמנהלים`

@ref akn:art_7/p1
DECLARE `merged supplement` IS ONE OF
    `the 87 supplement`
    `the 2001 supplement`
    `the 2008 supplement`
    `the 2011 supplement`
    `the 2011 erosion supplement`
    `the 2016 percentage supplement`

-- §7 (new section 6(a)-(c) of the merger agreement): from 1.9.2017, for
-- those outside the reform and principals, the six merged supplements are
-- no longer paid, with any right that flowed from paying them (a), every
-- source for them is cancelled (b), and they are no longer a base for
-- other supplements (c). The '94 supplement is not among them (§10).
@ref akn:art_7/p1
GIVEN e IS AN `employee`, s IS A `merged supplement`, `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the merged supplement is cancelled, also as a base for others, for` e s `the day` IF
    `is outside the reform or a principal` (e's `category`) AND `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 9 2017

§§ `8 מנהלים ברפורמה`

-- §8.1: for principals in the reform, the transition-to-reform supplement
-- (section 24 of Oz LeTmura) is computed from 1.9.2017 on the combined
-- salary, the '94 supplement and the merger supplement only.
@ref akn:art_8__para_8-1
GIVEN `the day` IS A DATE
      `combined salary` IS A NUMBER
      `the 94 supplement` IS A NUMBER
      `the merger supplement amount` IS A NUMBER
      `the other supplements` IS A NUMBER @desc the 2001, 2008, 2011 and 2011-erosion supplements it was computed on before
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the base of the transition-to-reform supplement` `the day` `combined salary` `the 94 supplement` `the merger supplement amount` `the other supplements` IS
    IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 9 2017
    THEN `combined salary` PLUS `the 94 supplement` PLUS `the merger supplement amount`
    ELSE `combined salary` PLUS `the 94 supplement` PLUS `the other supplements`

-- §8.2: the "87 transition-to-reform" supplement stands at 88.52 on
-- signature and moves only by section 4(d) of the agreement of 23.3.17.
-- art_8__para_8-2 here, against circular תשע"ח/3's words: "ועדת" for "וועדת".
@ref akn:art_8__para_8-2 akn:art_8__para_8-2/p2
GIVEN `update under section 4(d) of 23.3.17` IS A NUMBER @desc the cumulative update that mechanism gives, as a fraction; set elsewhere
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 87 transition supplement on signature, updated` `update under section 4(d) of 23.3.17` IS
    88.52 TIMES (1 PLUS `update under section 4(d) of 23.3.17`)

§§ `9 ביטול הוראות בסעיף 6 להסכם מיזוג רכיבים`

-- §9: section 6(c)'s tail from "כך למשל" and section 6(d) of the merger
-- agreement are repealed for teachers in the reform and outside it.
DECLARE `merger-agreement provision` IS ONE OF
    `section 6(c) tail from "for example"`
    `section 6(d)`
    `another provision`

@ref akn:art_9 akn:art_9__para_a akn:art_9__para_b
GIVEN p IS A `merger-agreement provision`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is repealed for teachers by section 9` p IF
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN `another provision` THEN FALSE
    OTHERWISE TRUE

§§ `10 תוספת '94 למורים שאינם ברפורמה ומנהלים`

-- §10.1: the cancellation of the '94 supplement under the merger agreement
-- is itself cancelled back to 1.9.2017; §10.2-§10.3 set its amount.
@ref akn:art_10__para_10-1 akn:art_10__para_10-2 akn:art_10__para_10-3
GIVEN e IS AN `employee`, `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 94 supplement outside the reform` e `the day` IS
    IF NOT `is outside the reform or a principal` (e's `category`)
    THEN 0
    ELSE IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 12 2018
         THEN 164.51
         ELSE IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 9 2017
              THEN 162.56
              ELSE 0

§§ `11 ביצוע למפרע`

DECLARE `provision of this agreement` IS ONE OF
    `4.3`, `4.5`, `5.2`, `5.3`, `6`, `7`, `10.1`, `10.2`

-- §11.1-§11.2: the listed provisions are one arrangement, carried out
-- together or not at all.
-- art_11__para_11-1, art_11__para_11-2 here, against circular תשע"ח/3's words: the cross-references in this agreement's numbering (§§4.2–4.3 for the circular's 4.3–4.5), and "יישם" for "ייושם".
@ref akn:art_11__para_11-1 akn:art_11__para_11-2
GIVEN `provisions implemented` IS A LIST OF `provision of this agreement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the implementation is lawful` `provisions implemented` IF
        count `provisions implemented` EQUALS 0
    OR  all (GIVEN p YIELD elem p `provisions implemented`)
            (LIST `4.3`, `4.5`, `5.2`, `5.3`, `6`, `7`, `10.1`, `10.2`)

-- §11.3: those outside the reform and principals are not required to repay
-- "the excess amount" — what the former merger agreement made their gross
-- salary for 1.9.2017-31.1.2018 exceed the gross due for it under this one.
@ref akn:art_11__para_11-3
GIVEN e IS AN `employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `not required to repay the excess amount` e IF
    `is outside the reform or a principal` (e's `category`)

GIVEN `gross due under the former merger agreement` IS A NUMBER @desc for 1.9.2017 to 31.1.2018
      `gross due under this agreement` IS A NUMBER @desc for the same period
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the excess amount` `gross due under the former merger agreement` `gross due under this agreement` IS
    max 0 (`gross due under the former merger agreement` MINUS `gross due under this agreement`)

-- (`pay for make-up lessons` and `pay the advance` are the circular's §19,
-- which makes up the strike days the agreement's §24 orders.)
DECLARE `wage action` IS ONE OF
    `implement the agreement in the salary` HAS `arrears since 1.9.2017 paid` IS A NUMBER
    `send written notice of the error's details and a chance to respond`
    `deduct an overpayment` HAS `deducted` IS A NUMBER
    `pay the one-time grant` HAS `grant paid` IS A NUMBER
    `pay for make-up lessons` HAS `make-up pay` IS A NUMBER
    `pay the advance` HAS `advance paid` IS A NUMBER
    `issue implementation guidelines to principals`

-- §11.4: from the April 2018 salary (8), no later than the May 2018 salary
-- (9), with the differences since 1.9.2017.
@ref akn:art_11__para_11-4
GIVEN `arrears owed` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `wage action`
DECIDE `carrying out the agreement` `arrears owed` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `implement the agreement in the salary` `paid`
          PROVIDED `paid` AT LEAST `arrears owed`
    WITHIN 9
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "section 11.4: no later than the salary for May 2018, with the differences since 1.9.2017"

-- §11.5: up to the August 2018 salary (12), an overpayment by an error in
-- implementing the agreement is an advance on wages (Wage Protection Law
-- 1958, section 25(a)(7)).
@ref akn:art_11__para_11-5
GIVEN `salary month` IS A NUMBER, `overpaid by an implementation error` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the overpayment counts as an advance on wages` `salary month` `overpaid by an implementation error` IF
    `overpaid by an implementation error` AND `salary month` AT MOST 12

-- §11.6: written notice of the details of the error 30 days before the
-- deduction begins, with an individual chance to respond before it is made
-- (days from the notice); then deduction in twelve equal monthly parts.
@ref akn:art_11__para_11-6
GIVEN `overpayment` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `wage action`
DECIDE `written notice 30 days before deducting an overpayment` `overpayment` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `send written notice of the error's details and a chance to respond`
    HENCE (PARTY `the employer`
           SHANT `deduct an overpayment` `any amount`
           WITHIN 30
           HENCE (PARTY `the employer`
                  MAY `deduct an overpayment` `amount`
                      PROVIDED `amount` AT MOST `overpayment` DIVIDED BY 12)
           LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "section 11.6: no deduction until 30 days after the written notice")
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "section 11.6: written notice of the error before the deduction begins"

-- akn:art_11__para_11-7 The union's statement that the section admits no error in any salary; no rule.

§§ `12 ביצוע לגבי מורים ברפורמה`

-- §12: for teachers in the reform the changes this agreement makes to the
-- merger agreement create no retroactive liability, and payments already
-- made under the merger agreement are not made again.
@ref akn:art_12/p1
GIVEN e IS AN `employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `no retroactive liability and no double payment for` e IF
    NOT `is outside the reform or a principal` (e's `category`)

§§ `13 גמול יועץ חינוכי`

@desc A printed row of the counsellor's stipend table: years of counselling and the rate, in percent, at signature, from 1.1.2020 and from 1.1.2021.
DECLARE `counsellor row` HAS
    `counselling years from` IS A NUMBER @desc 5 stands for "5 ומעלה"
    `rate at signature`      IS A NUMBER
    `rate from 1.1.2020`     IS A NUMBER
    `rate from 1.1.2021`     IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:art_13__para_13-1 akn:art_13__para_13-1/t1
`the counsellor's stipend table` MEANS
    LIST `counsellor row` 1 5 6   6.5,
         `counsellor row` 2 6 7   8,
         `counsellor row` 3 7 8.5 9.5,
         `counsellor row` 4 8 10  10.5,
         `counsellor row` 5 9 11  12

-- §13.2: the stipend's other rules (section 17(a) of Oz LeTmura) are
-- unchanged; its base among them is an input.
@ref akn:art_13__para_13-1 akn:art_13__para_13-2
GIVEN `counselling years` IS A NUMBER, `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the counsellor's stipend rate` `counselling years` `the day` IS
    sum (map (GIVEN r YIELD IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 1 2021
                            THEN r's `rate from 1.1.2021` DIVIDED BY 100
                            ELSE IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 1 2020
                                 THEN r's `rate from 1.1.2020` DIVIDED BY 100
                                 ELSE r's `rate at signature` DIVIDED BY 100)
             (filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `counselling years from` EQUALS min `counselling years` 5)
                     `the counsellor's stipend table`))

§§ `14 גמולי תפקיד חדשים`

@ref akn:art_14__para_14-2 akn:art_14__para_14-2__subpara_1 akn:art_14__para_14-2__subpara_2 akn:art_14__para_14-2__subpara_3 akn:art_14__para_14-2__subpara_4 akn:art_14__para_14-2__subpara_5 akn:art_14__para_14-2__subpara_6
DECLARE `new role` IS ONE OF
    `trips coordinator`
    `pedagogical coordinator`
    `integration and special populations coordinator`
    `ICT coordinator`
    `matriculation coordinator`
    `discipline and school climate coordinator`

-- §14.1: from 1.9.2019 a teacher in the reform filling one of the new roles
-- earns a role stipend of 6% of the combined salary and the Oz LeTmura
-- supplement; §14.3: the subject coordinator's rules of calculation and
-- payment apply.
@ref akn:art_14__para_14-1 akn:art_14__para_14-3
GIVEN e IS AN `employee`, `the day` IS A DATE
      `fills one of the new roles` IS A BOOLEAN @desc one of the roles listed in section 14.2
      `combined salary` IS A NUMBER, `Oz LeTmura supplement` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the new role stipend` e `the day` `fills one of the new roles` `combined salary` `Oz LeTmura supplement` IS
    IF  e's `category` EQUALS `a teacher in the reform` AND `fills one of the new roles` AND `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 9 2019
    THEN 0.06 TIMES (`combined salary` PLUS `Oz LeTmura supplement`)
    ELSE 0


§§ `15 גמול מורה חונך`

-- §15.1: from 1.9.2018 a mentor teacher earns 2.4% per intern, up to three
-- interns, on the base §15.1(1)-(2) set; §15.2: the subject coordinator's
-- rules apply. A principal has no base (F-2017-18_tashach_03-d).
@ref akn:art_15__para_15-1 akn:art_15__para_15-2
GIVEN `the day` IS A DATE, `interns` IS A NUMBER, `base` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the mentor stipend` `the day` `interns` `base` IS
    IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 9 2018
    THEN `the mentor rate per intern` TIMES min `interns` 3 TIMES `base`
    ELSE 0

`the mentor rate per intern` MEANS 0.024

-- §15.1(1)-(2): the base, for a teacher in the reform and for one outside
-- it (for the avoidance of doubt, not a principal).
@ref akn:art_15__para_15-1__subpara_1 akn:art_15__para_15-1__subpara_2
GIVEN c IS AN `employee category`
      `combined salary` IS A NUMBER, `Oz LeTmura supplement` IS A NUMBER
      `the 94 supplement` IS A NUMBER, `the merger supplement amount` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the mentor stipend base` c `combined salary` `Oz LeTmura supplement` `the 94 supplement` `the merger supplement amount` IS
    CONSIDER c
    WHEN `a teacher in the reform`     THEN JUST (`combined salary` PLUS `Oz LeTmura supplement`)
    WHEN `a teacher not in the reform` THEN JUST (`combined salary` PLUS `the 94 supplement` PLUS `the merger supplement amount`)
    OTHERWISE NOTHING

§§ `16 גמול השתלמות`

-- §16 (new section 18(1)(2) of Oz LeTmura): from 1.9.2019 the cap of
-- training units is 19, beside double-degree units; the 19th unit counts
-- only courses starting no earlier than school year תשע"ט or the year the
-- teacher began under the reform, the later of them. Sections 18(d)-(h)(1)
-- apply to it too (not encoded here).
@ref akn:art_16/p1
GIVEN `the day` IS A DATE, `units earned` IS A NUMBER
      `the cap under section 18(1)` IS A NUMBER @desc the cap of training units of section 18(1) of Oz LeTmura, which this agreement does not restate
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `training units recognised` `the day` `units earned` `the cap under section 18(1)` IS
    IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 9 2019
    THEN min `units earned` 19
    ELSE min `units earned` `the cap under section 18(1)`

@ref akn:art_16/p1
GIVEN `course start` IS A DATE, `start of the teacher's first reform year` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a course may count towards the 19th unit` `course start` `start of the teacher's first reform year` IF
        `course start` AT LEAST Date 1 9 2018
    AND `course start` AT LEAST `start of the teacher's first reform year`

§§ `17 מענק חד פעמי`

@desc An employee's months in the grant period 1.9.2017-30.11.2017.
DECLARE `grant month` HAS
    `position fraction that month` IS A NUMBER  @desc the (weighted) position; for a month wholly in maternity, reserve or unpaid sick leave, the fraction on the eve of it (§17f)
    `kind of month` IS A `kind of grant month`

DECLARE `kind of grant month` IS ONE OF
    `worked`
    `maternity and parenthood, reserve duty or unpaid sick leave`
    `unpaid leave, sabbatical or leave treated as unpaid`
    `not employed`

-- art_17__para_a here, against circular תשע"ח/3's words: "ש"ה" for "ש"ח" in the amount in words.
@ref akn:art_17__para_a
`the one-time grant` MEANS 1000

-- §17e-§17g: unpaid leave (sabbatical included, and leave treated as
-- unpaid, also after maternity leave ends) does not count; reserve duty,
-- maternity and parenthood leave and unpaid sick leave do.
@ref akn:art_17__para_e akn:art_17__para_e/p2 akn:art_17__para_g
GIVEN m IS A `grant month`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the month counts as work` m IF
    CONSIDER m's `kind of month`
    WHEN `worked` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `maternity and parenthood, reserve duty or unpaid sick leave` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE


-- §17f: for those months the fraction is the one on the eve of the leave;
-- §17c, §17d, §17f: never above 100% in a month.
-- art_17__para_d here, against circular תשע"ח/3's words: "להלק" for "לחלק".
@ref akn:art_17__para_f akn:art_17__para_f/p2 akn:art_17__para_c akn:art_17__para_d
GIVEN m IS A `grant month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the month's share` m IS
    IF `the month counts as work` m
    THEN min (m's `position fraction that month`) 1 DIVIDED BY 3
    ELSE 0

-- §17a-§17d: full grant for a full position all the period, else in
-- proportion to the period worked and the (weighted) position.
@ref akn:art_17__para_a akn:art_17__para_b akn:art_17__para_c akn:art_17__para_d
GIVEN `the three months` IS A LIST OF `grant month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the one-time grant due` `the three months` IS
    `the one-time grant` TIMES sum (map `the month's share` `the three months`)

-- §17h-§17j: the grant is not salary, and what it is not counted for.
DECLARE `grant purpose` IS ONE OF
    `salary for any matter`
    `the hourly value for substitution hours`
    `salary reduction for an hour of absence`
    `severance pay`
    `provident deposits`
    `topping up to the minimum wage`
    `the combined-salary base`

@ref akn:art_17__para_h akn:art_17__para_i akn:art_17__para_j
GIVEN u IS A `grant purpose`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the grant counts for` u IF FALSE

-- §17a: paid with the March 2018 salary (7), no later than April's (8).
@ref akn:art_17__para_a/p2
GIVEN `the three months` IS A LIST OF `grant month`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `wage action`
DECIDE `paying the one-time grant` `the three months` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the one-time grant` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `the one-time grant due` `the three months`
    WITHIN 8
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "section 17a: no later than the salary for April 2018"



-- not weighed against `the Severance Pay Law`: §6's new §5א(ד) counts the
-- components merger supplement in the wage severance is computed on, and
-- §17(ח) leaves the grant out of it. Which components count, §13 sends to
-- the regulations, which compute that wage by the collective agreement that
-- applies (as the takanon's §1.28.2.3 brings them): a component counted
-- adds to the severance, and for one left out the agreement's word is what
-- the law looks to; §13ב's minimum-wage floor holds whatever is counted.

-- Against the Minimum Wage Law's floor (MMS-601): §6 (the merger
-- agreement's new 5א(ה)) and §17(ט) leave the merger supplement and the
-- one-time grant out of the pay that counts toward the top-up, which makes
-- the top-up the law's or more (its §11). Checked on a month's figures as if §3 counted
-- each (a fixed supplement for the work), the strictest case.
#ASSERT NOT `counting a component as the instrument does falls below the Minimum Wage Law` 5300 4800 (`component paid in the month under the Minimum Wage Law` `a fixed supplement paid for the work, under section 3(ב)(3)` 300) (`the merger supplement counts for` `topping up to the minimum wage`)
#ASSERT NOT `counting a component as the instrument does falls below the Minimum Wage Law` 5300 4800 (`component paid in the month under the Minimum Wage Law` `a fixed supplement paid for the work, under section 3(ב)(3)` 300) (`the grant counts for` `topping up to the minimum wage`)

-- Against the Wage Protection Law (MMS-601): by §11.5, up to the salary
-- of August 2018 an overpayment made by an error
-- in carrying out the agreement is an advance on wages for §25(א)(7), and
-- §11.6 deducts it in twelve equal parts — within §25 for any overpayment
-- up to three months' wages, the section's own cap carrying the rest.
#ASSERT `the overpayment counts as an advance on wages` 12 TRUE
#ASSERT `section 25 of the Wage Protection Law permits the deduction` `an advance on account of wages`
#ASSERT `equal monthly parts of the advance stay within section 25` 30000 10000 12

DECLARE `action of 14.3.2018` IS ONE OF
    `agree the managers' budget in a collective agreement by 1.4.2018`
    `allocate the managers' budget`
    `declare a labour dispute or take organisational measures over the managers' budget`
    `transfer the yearly sum to the union's fund`
    `make up the school days the strike lost`
    `negotiate further economic demands to 28.2.2022`
    `strike, lock out or disrupt work over what the agreement of 14.3.2018 settles`

§§ `18 תקציב לשכר המנהלים`

-- (א): a budget to raise the managers' pay, its allocation to be agreed and
-- set in a collective agreement by 1.4.2018: (1) 10 million shekels for
-- תשע"ט (from 1.9.2018); (2) 20 million a school year from תש"פ (from
-- 1.9.2019). The sums are the cost of the allocation, not what any one
-- manager is paid.
@ref akn:art_18__para_a akn:art_18__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_18__para_a__subpara_2
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the managers' budget of 14.3.2018 for the year from` d IS
    BRANCH IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2019) THEN 20000000
           IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2018) THEN 10000000
           OTHERWISE 0

`the managers' budget's agreement is due by` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 4 2018

-- (ב): if no such agreement is signed by 1.4.2018, the budget goes to the
-- "87 transition supplement": from 1.9.2018 it rises by 460 shekels to
-- 548.52, and from 1.9.2019 by 460 more to 1,008.52, its other rules
-- unchanged, and no further negotiation is held on the cost.
@ref akn:art_18__para_b akn:art_18__para_b__subpara_1 akn:art_18__para_b__subpara_2
GIVEN `an agreement on the managers' budget was signed by 1.4.2018` IS A BOOLEAN, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the 87 transition supplement under §18(ב)` `an agreement on the managers' budget was signed by 1.4.2018` d IS
    IF `an agreement on the managers' budget was signed by 1.4.2018`
    THEN NOTHING
    ELSE BRANCH IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2019) THEN JUST 1008.52
                IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2018) THEN JUST 548.52
                OTHERWISE NOTHING

#ASSERT 548.52 PLUS 460 EQUALS 1008.52
#ASSERT `the 87 transition supplement under §18(ב)` FALSE (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2019) EQUALS JUST 1008.52

-- (ג): this takes nothing from §27's industrial peace, and no dispute is
-- declared nor measures taken for want of agreement on the allocation.
@ref akn:art_18__para_c
`no dispute over the managers' budget` MEANS
    PARTY `the secondary teachers' organisation`
    SHANT `declare a labour dispute or take organisational measures over the managers' budget`

§§ `19–22 קרנות ארגון המורים`

-- §19: to the union's distress fund, a further 4 million shekels over
-- 2018–2021, a million each year by December. §20: the same to the loans
-- fund set up under §יב of the agreement of 12.9.95. §21: by §19 of the
-- agreement of 10.9.2003 it is renewed, so that the sick-days fund set up by
-- the agreement of 25.6.1995 resumes, its §§4–19 applying; the same 4
-- million over 2018–2021 funds it.
@ref akn:art_19/p1 akn:art_20/p1 akn:art_21/p1
`the yearly sum to each of the funds of §§19–21` MEANS 1000000
`the years of §§19–21` MEANS LIST 2018, 2019, 2020, 2021

#ASSERT `the yearly sum to each of the funds of §§19–21` TIMES 4 EQUALS 4000000

-- not weighed against `the Sick Pay Law`: §21 renews the sick-days fund
-- and funds it; the grants it pays are §§4–19 of the agreement of
-- 25.6.1995, which is outside the corpus. The renewal of 10.9.2003, which
-- the corpus holds, is weighed in its own file: the fund pays only after
-- the accrued sick days are used, when the law has nothing left to give.
-- §21 itself rules nothing on sick pay.

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `action of 14.3.2018`
DECIDE `paying a fund of §§19–21 in` y IS
    IF elem y `the years of §§19–21`
    THEN PARTY `the employer`
         MUST  `transfer the yearly sum to the union's fund`
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- §22: from 2018 a million shekels is added for good to the base sum of the
-- union's fund for professional development (קרן ידע), updated each year
-- as the base is; from 2019 another million, so the base rises by 2
-- million against its value on the eve of the agreement. The base itself
-- is an input.
@ref akn:art_22/p1 akn:art_22/p2
GIVEN `the base sum on the eve of 14.3.2018, as updated` IS A NUMBER, y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the knowledge fund's base under §22` `the base sum on the eve of 14.3.2018, as updated` y IS
    BRANCH IF y AT LEAST 2019 THEN `the base sum on the eve of 14.3.2018, as updated` PLUS 2000000
           IF y AT LEAST 2018 THEN `the base sum on the eve of 14.3.2018, as updated` PLUS 1000000
           OTHERWISE `the base sum on the eve of 14.3.2018, as updated`

