-- akn:att_4__hc_1/p1 The signatures under annex ד'; no rule.

-- Which annex a table §4 names is (`the reform table in force` and its
-- like name them): the rows here.
GIVEN a IS A `combined-salary table`
GIVETH A LIST OF `row of the Oz tables of 14.3.2018`
DECIDE `the rows of the annex of 14.3.2018` a IS
    CONSIDER a
    WHEN `the tables before this agreement` THEN EMPTY
    WHEN `annex A, reform, from 1.9.2017` THEN `the rows of annex א' of 14.3.2018`
    WHEN `annex B, reform, from 1.9.2018` THEN `the rows of annex ב' of 14.3.2018`
    WHEN `annex C, reform, from 1.12.2018` THEN `the rows of annex ג' of 14.3.2018`
    WHEN `annex D, outside the reform and principals, from 1.9.2018` THEN `the rows of annex ד' of 14.3.2018`

GIVEN `the rows` IS A LIST OF `row of the Oz tables of 14.3.2018`
      y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE `row of the Oz tables of 14.3.2018`
DECIDE `the row for a year of seniority, 14.3.2018` `the rows` y IS
    CONSIDER filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `its seniority, 14.3.2018` EQUALS y) `the rows`
    WHEN r FOLLOWED BY rest THEN JUST r
    WHEN EMPTY THEN NOTHING

#ASSERT count (`the rows of annex א' of 14.3.2018`) EQUALS 36
#ASSERT count (`the rows of annex ד' of 14.3.2018`) EQUALS 36
#ASSERT CONSIDER `the row for a year of seniority, 14.3.2018` (`the rows of the annex of 14.3.2018` `annex A, reform, from 1.9.2017`) 1
        WHEN JUST r THEN r's `a doctorate, 14.3.2018` EQUALS 3978.57
        WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
#ASSERT CONSIDER `the row for a year of seniority, 14.3.2018` (`the rows of the annex of 14.3.2018` `annex D, outside the reform and principals, from 1.9.2018`) 36
        WHEN JUST r THEN r's `a certified teacher, 14.3.2018` EQUALS 5519.79
        WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE


§§ `Worked examples`

-- Salary figures are placeholders, not from any payslip.
`an employee outside the reform` MEANS `employee` WITH
    `covered by the Oz LeTmura agreement of 14.8.2011` IS TRUE
    `category` IS `a teacher not in the reform`
`an employee in the reform` MEANS `employee` WITH
    `covered by the Oz LeTmura agreement of 14.8.2011` IS TRUE
    `category` IS `a teacher in the reform`

#ASSERT `the updated shekel supplement 2016 for a full position` `an employee in the reform` (Date 1 3 2018) EQUALS 832.62
#ASSERT `the updated shekel supplement 2016 for a full position` `an employee outside the reform` (Date 1 9 2021) EQUALS 1168.97
#ASSERT `the merger supplement` `an employee outside the reform` (Date 1 1 2018) 10000 EQUALS 1895.1
#ASSERT `the merger supplement` `an employee in the reform` (Date 1 1 2018) 10000 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the 94 supplement outside the reform` `an employee outside the reform` (Date 1 1 2019) EQUALS 164.51
#ASSERT `the table in force for` `an employee in the reform` (Date 1 10 2018) 5 EQUALS `annex B, reform, from 1.9.2018`
#ASSERT `the table in force for` `an employee in the reform` (Date 1 10 2018) 12 EQUALS `annex A, reform, from 1.9.2017`
#ASSERT `the table in force for` `an employee outside the reform` (Date 1 10 2017) 5 EQUALS `the tables before this agreement`
#ASSERT `the counsellor's stipend rate` 7 (Date 1 6 2021) EQUALS 0.12
#ASSERT `the counsellor's stipend rate` 2 (Date 1 6 2018) EQUALS 0.06
#ASSERT `the mentor stipend` (Date 1 9 2018) 4 10000 EQUALS 720
#ASSERT `the one-time grant due` (LIST `grant month` 1 `worked`, `grant month` 1 `worked`, `grant month` 1 `worked`) EQUALS 1000
#ASSERT `the one-time grant due` (LIST `grant month` 0.5 `worked`, `grant month` 1.2 `maternity and parenthood, reserve duty or unpaid sick leave`, `grant month` 1 `unpaid leave, sabbatical or leave treated as unpaid`) EQUALS 500
#ASSERT `the implementation is lawful` (LIST `4.3`, `4.5`, `5.2`, `5.3`, `6`, `7`, `10.1`, `10.2`)
#ASSERT NOT `the implementation is lawful` (LIST `6`, `7`)


#TRACE `written notice 30 days before deducting an overpayment` 1200 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `send written notice of the error's details and a chance to respond` AT 0
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `deduct an overpayment` 100 AT 31
#TRACE `carrying out the agreement` 900 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `implement the agreement in the salary` 900 AT 8
#TRACE `paying the one-time grant` (LIST `grant month` 1 `worked`, `grant month` 1 `worked`, `grant month` 1 `worked`) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the one-time grant` 1000 AT 9

§§ `Property checks`

-- §§2–17 over a finite space: every category; the first and last days
-- around every date they name; seniority 1 to 10; counselling years 1 to 7;
-- 0 to 5 interns; the eight retroactive provisions; three grant months of
-- every kind.

`both booleans` MEANS LIST TRUE, FALSE
`every category` MEANS
    LIST `a teacher in the reform`, `a teacher not in the reform`, `a principal in the reform`, `a principal not in the reform`
`the days checked` MEANS
    LIST Date 31 8 2017, Date 1 9 2017, Date 31 12 2017, Date 1 1 2018, Date 31 5 2018, Date 1 6 2018,
         Date 31 8 2018, Date 1 9 2018, Date 30 11 2018, Date 1 12 2018, Date 1 1 2019, Date 1 9 2019,
         Date 1 1 2020, Date 1 9 2020, Date 1 1 2021, Date 1 9 2021, Date 1 3 2022
`the eight provisions` MEANS LIST `4.3`, `4.5`, `5.2`, `5.3`, `6`, `7`, `10.1`, `10.2`
`every month kind` MEANS
    LIST `worked`, `maternity and parenthood, reserve duty or unpaid sick leave`,
         `unpaid leave, sabbatical or leave treated as unpaid`, `not employed`

GIVEN c IS AN `employee category`
GIVETH AN `employee`
DECIDE `an employee of` c IS
    `employee` WITH
        `covered by the Oz LeTmura agreement of 14.8.2011` IS TRUE
        `category` IS c

-- §§2-3: one group is the reform's teachers, the other everyone else;
-- principals are the two principal categories.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN c YIELD
                    `is outside the reform or a principal` c EQUALS (NOT (c EQUALS `a teacher in the reform`))
                AND `is a principal` c EQUALS (c EQUALS `a principal in the reform` OR c EQUALS `a principal not in the reform`))
            `every category`

-- §4 over every category, day and seniority: no table of this agreement
-- before 1.9.2017; outside the reform, annex D exactly for seniority 1-7
-- from 1.9.2018 and the old tables otherwise; in the reform, annex C from
-- 1.12.2018 whatever the seniority.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN c YIELD
                all (GIVEN d YIELD
                        all (GIVEN n YIELD
                                LET t MEANS `the table in force for` (`an employee of` c) d n
                                IN      ((d AT LEAST Date 1 9 2017) OR t EQUALS `the tables before this agreement`)
                                    AND ((NOT `is outside the reform or a principal` c)
                                         OR t EQUALS (IF d AT LEAST Date 1 9 2018 AND n AT MOST 7
                                                      THEN `annex D, outside the reform and principals, from 1.9.2018`
                                                      ELSE `the tables before this agreement`))
                                    AND (`is outside the reform or a principal` c OR (d LESS THAN Date 1 12 2018) OR t EQUALS `annex C, reform, from 1.12.2018`))
                            (range 1 10))
                    `the days checked`)
            `every category`

-- §5 over every category and day: no amount before 1.9.2017, exactly one
-- period from it in each schedule; the reform's amount is above the other
-- group's on every day; and neither ever falls.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN d YIELD
                    all (GIVEN ps YIELD
                            count (filter (GIVEN p YIELD d AT LEAST p's `period from` AND d AT MOST p's `period to`) ps)
                            EQUALS (IF d AT LEAST Date 1 9 2017 THEN 1 ELSE 0))
                        (LIST `the reform shekel supplement`, `the shekel supplement outside the reform`)
                AND ((d LESS THAN Date 1 9 2017)
                     OR `the amount on` `the shekel supplement outside the reform` d LESS THAN `the amount on` `the reform shekel supplement` d)
                AND all (GIVEN c YIELD
                            all (GIVEN e YIELD
                                    (e LESS THAN d)
                                    OR `the updated shekel supplement 2016 for a full position` (`an employee of` c) d
                                       AT MOST `the updated shekel supplement 2016 for a full position` (`an employee of` c) e)
                                `the days checked`)
                        `every category`)
            `the days checked`

-- §§6, 7, 10 and 12 over every category and day: the merger supplement and
-- the '94 supplement are paid, and the merged supplements cancelled,
-- exactly outside the reform and from 1.9.2017; neither amount ever falls;
-- §12 shields exactly the reform's teachers.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN c YIELD
                all (GIVEN d YIELD
                        LET o MEANS `is outside the reform or a principal` c
                            on MEANS d AT LEAST Date 1 9 2017
                            e MEANS `an employee of` c
                        IN      (`the merger supplement rate` e d GREATER THAN 0) EQUALS (o AND on)
                            AND (`the 94 supplement outside the reform` e d GREATER THAN 0) EQUALS (o AND on)
                            AND `the merged supplement is cancelled, also as a base for others, for` e `the 2008 supplement` d EQUALS (o AND on)
                            AND `no retroactive liability and no double payment for` e EQUALS (NOT o)
                            AND `the merger supplement rate` e d AT MOST `the merger supplement rate` e (Date 1 1 2022)
                            AND `the 94 supplement outside the reform` e d AT MOST `the 94 supplement outside the reform` e (Date 1 1 2022))
                    `the days checked`)
            `every category`

-- §8.1 over the days: the base drops the other supplements for the merger
-- supplement from 1.9.2017.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN d YIELD
                `the base of the transition-to-reform supplement` d 10000 160 1900 700
                EQUALS (IF d AT LEAST Date 1 9 2017 THEN 12060 ELSE 10860))
            `the days checked`

-- §11.1-§11.2: all eight provisions or none; leaving out any one, or
-- carrying out any one alone, is unlawful.
#ASSERT `the implementation is lawful` `the eight provisions`
#ASSERT `the implementation is lawful` EMPTY
#ASSERT all (GIVEN p YIELD
                    NOT `the implementation is lawful` (filter (GIVEN q YIELD NOT (q EQUALS p)) `the eight provisions`)
                AND NOT `the implementation is lawful` (LIST p))
            `the eight provisions`

-- §11.3-§11.6: the excess is never negative and is the difference where
-- positive; an advance on wages exactly for an error up to August 2018.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN a YIELD
                all (GIVEN b YIELD `the excess amount` a b EQUALS (IF a GREATER THAN b THEN a MINUS b ELSE 0)) (LIST 0, 500, 1000))
            (LIST 0, 500, 1000)
#ASSERT all (GIVEN m YIELD
                all (GIVEN o YIELD `the overpayment counts as an advance on wages` m o EQUALS (o AND m AT MOST 12)) `both booleans`)
            (range 1 15)

-- §13 over counselling years 1 to 7 and the days: the rate rises with the
-- years (from five on, the five-year row) and never falls with time.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN d YIELD
                all (GIVEN n YIELD
                            `the counsellor's stipend rate` n d AT MOST `the counsellor's stipend rate` (n PLUS 1) d
                        AND `the counsellor's stipend rate` n d AT MOST `the counsellor's stipend rate` n (Date 1 1 2022)
                        AND `the counsellor's stipend rate` n d GREATER THAN 0)
                    (range 1 7))
            `the days checked`

-- §14 over every category and day: the role stipend is 6% exactly for a
-- teacher in the reform in a new role from 1.9.2019; the principal's
-- choice of roles never falls with time and reaches three.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN c YIELD
                all (GIVEN d YIELD
                        all (GIVEN f YIELD
                                `the new role stipend` (`an employee of` c) d f 10000 1000
                                EQUALS (IF c EQUALS `a teacher in the reform` AND f AND d AT LEAST Date 1 9 2019 THEN 660 ELSE 0))
                            `both booleans`)
                    `the days checked`)
            `every category`

-- §15 over interns 0 to 5 and the days: 2.4% per intern up to three from
-- 1.9.2018; a base exactly for the two teacher categories.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN d YIELD
                all (GIVEN i YIELD
                        `the mentor stipend` d i 10000
                        EQUALS (IF d AT LEAST Date 1 9 2018 THEN 240 TIMES min i 3 ELSE 0))
                    (range 0 5))
            `the days checked`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN c YIELD
                (`the mentor stipend base` c 10000 1000 160 1900 EQUALS NOTHING) EQUALS `is a principal` c)
            `every category`

-- §16 over units 15 to 22: never more than 19 from 1.9.2019, and never
-- more than earned.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN u YIELD
                    `training units recognised` (Date 1 9 2019) u 16 EQUALS min u 19
                AND `training units recognised` (Date 1 9 2018) u 16 AT MOST u)
            (range 15 22)

-- §17 over three months of every kind and a position of 0.5, 1 or 1.2:
-- the grant is never negative, never above 1,000, and a third of 1,000 for
-- each month that counts, by its position up to one.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN a YIELD
                all (GIVEN b YIELD
                        all (GIVEN f YIELD
                                LET ms MEANS LIST `grant month` f a, `grant month` f b, `grant month` 1 `worked`
                                    g MEANS `the one-time grant due` ms
                                IN      g AT LEAST 0
                                    AND g AT MOST 1000
                                    AND g EQUALS 1000 TIMES ((count (filter (GIVEN m YIELD `the month counts as work` m) (take 2 ms)) TIMES min f 1) PLUS 1) DIVIDED BY 3)
                            (LIST 0.5, 1, 1.2))
                    `every month kind`)
            `every month kind`
